Propellerhead Remote Mapping File
File Format Version	1.0.0
Control Surface Manufacturer	Akai
Control Surface Model	MPK Mini Play
Map Version	1.0.0


//======================================================================
//  Grain Sample Manipulator
//
//  Pads      -> reserved (modulation templates below)
//  Knobs 1-4A-> sample / filter group   (CC21-24)
//  Knobs 1-4B-> amp envelope group      (CC25-28)
//  Joystick X-> Pitch Bend
//  Joystick Y-> Mod Wheel
//  Keyboard  -> Keyboard
//======================================================================

Scope	Propellerhead Software	se.propellerheads.Grain
// Define Group	Keyboard Shortcut Variations	Sample	Filter	Amp	Effects
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item	Scale	Mode

Map	_Scope		"Grain"
Map	Keyboard		Keyboard

// --- Pads (reserved) ---------------------------------
// Grain has no drum pads; ready-to-enable templates:
//Map	Pad 1		Voices
//Map	Pad 2		Amp Gain
//Map	Pad 3		Amp Velocity
//Map	Pad 4		Filter Env2
//Map	Pad 5		Filter Vel
//Map	Pad 6		Filter Kbd
//Map	Pad 7		Select Previous Patch
//Map	Pad 8		Select Next Patch

// --- Knob Bank A (CC21-24): sample & filter ----------
Map	Knob 1 A		Sample Level
Map	Knob 2 A		Osc Level
Map	Knob 3 A		Filter Freq
Map	Knob 4 A		Filter Reso

// --- Knob Bank B (CC25-28): amplitude envelope -------
Map	Knob 1 B		Amp Attack
Map	Knob 2 B		Amp Decay
Map	Knob 3 B		Amp Sustain
Map	Knob 4 B		Amp Release

// --- Joystick / wheels ------------------------------
Map	Joystick X		Pitch Bend
Map	Joystick Y		Mod Wheel